               QUERY PLAN               
----------------------------------------
 Aggregate
   ->  Custom Scan (LanceScan) on pairs
         Filter: (origin = 42)
         Lance Columns: origin
         Lance Filter: (`origin` = 42)
         Lance Index: pairs_origin
